        },
        "description": {
          "zh": "红四方面军由懋功南下，经丹巴、天全、芦山进至名山百丈关，先后进行绥崇丹懋、天芦名雅邛大战役。",
          "en": "The Fourth Front Army moved south from Maogong through Danba, Tianquan, and Lushan to Baizhang Pass in Mingshan, fighting the Suichong Danmao and Tian-Lu-Ming-Ya-Qiong-Da campaigns."
